        <obo:IAO_0000115>Organonitrogen compounds that have the general structure R&lt;small&gt;&lt;sup&gt;1&lt;/small&gt;&lt;/sup&gt;(R&lt;small&gt;&lt;sup&gt;2&lt;/small&gt;&lt;/sup&gt;)C=N(O)OH (R&lt;small&gt;&lt;sup&gt;1&lt;/small&gt;&lt;/sup&gt;,R&lt;small&gt;&lt;sup&gt;2&lt;/small&gt;&lt;/sup&gt; = H, organyl). They are tautomers of &lt;em&gt;C&lt;/em&gt;-nitro compounds.</obo:IAO_0000115>
