        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/CHEBI_47916"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>are a type of flavonoid pigments in plants. Anthoxanthins are water-soluble pigments which range in color from white or colorless to a creamy to yellow, often on petals of flowers.</obo:IAO_0000115>
