            </owl:Restriction>
        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>A cleaving reaction in which a peptide is treated with phenylisothiocyanate, removing the terminal amino acid group, to form the chain-shortened amine and a phenylthiohydantoin.</obo:IAO_0000115>
