            </owl:Restriction>
        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>The reaction of ortho- or para-phenolic (or ortho- or para-anilinic) aldehydes or ketones with hydrogen peroxide to form bisphenols (or hydroxy anilines) and carboxylic acids.</obo:IAO_0000115>
