        <rdfs:comment>IBX oxidation and Dess-Martin oxidation are alcohol oxidation by hypervalent iodine reagents. The Dess-Martin periodinane used for oxidation in the Dess-Martin oxidation is prepared by reacting IBX with acetic anhydride in DMSO.</rdfs:comment>
